---@field staticNodeCount? string Optional. Number of nodes to be statically created for this nodeset. The cluster will attempt to ensure that at least this many nodes exist at all times.
---@field storageConfigs? gcp.hypercomputecluster_v1.StorageConfigList Optional. How storage resources should be mounted on each compute node.

---@alias gcp.hypercomputecluster_v1.SlurmNodeSetList gcp.hypercomputecluster_v1.SlurmNodeSet[]

---When set in Orchestrator, indicates that the cluster should use [Slurm](https://slurm.schedmd.com/) as the orchestrator.
