---@field epilogBashScripts? gcp.hypercomputecluster_v1.StringList Optional. Slurm [epilog scripts](https://slurm.schedmd.com/prolog_epilog.html), which will be executed by compute nodes whenever a node finishes running a job. Values must not be empty.
---@field nodeSets? gcp.hypercomputecluster_v1.SlurmNodeSetList Optional. Compute resource configuration for the Slurm nodesets in your cluster. If not specified, the cluster won't create any nodes.
---@field defaultPartition? string Optional. Default partition to use for submitted jobs that do not explicitly specify a partition. Required if and only if there is more than one partition, in which case it must match the id of one of the partitions.

